// A reversible control promises the change can be taken back. This one keeps no
// reachable UNDO, and it does not declare that it acts, so MISSING_UNDO cannot see it
// (that diagnostic needs ACT in SATISFIES). ROLE_PROMISE_BROKEN fires only where
// MISSING_UNDO cannot, so one defect is never reported twice.
// Expected: ROLE_PROMISE_BROKEN

DEFINE INTERACTION archive_invoice (
  SATISFIES [SELECT],
  ROLE reversible
)
